[1064.7078268527985,"o","\u001b[17;3HThinking for \u001b[1m51s\u001b[22m, reading \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m file… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[2m\u001b[3m\u001b[18;6HNow I understand the full picture. The multi-service template shows the npm build pattern: \u001b[38;2;177;185;249myaml \u001b[19;6H.<PREFIX>-npm-build: extends: .build image: <NPM_BUILD_IMAGE> stage: build variables: BUILD_FOLDER: 'change_me' \u001b[m\r\n \u001b[1C   \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mARTIFACT_FOLDER: 'dist' script: - cd ${BUILD_FOLDER} - npm config set strict-ssl false - npm install && npm run \u001b[m\r\n     \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mbuild - zip -r \"${ARTIFACT_FOLDER}.zip\" \"${ARTIFACT_FOLDER}\" artifacts: expire_in: 1 week paths: - \u001b[22;6H\"${BUILD_FOLDER}/*.zip\"  \u001b[m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mImportant note: the multi-service npm-build zips the dist folder (\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mzip -r dist.zip dist\u001b[m\u001b[2m\u001b[3m). \u001b[23;6HBut for the ArgoCD Dockerfile path, the Dockerfile does \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mCOPY dist/ \u001b[m\u001b[2m\u001b[3m(not \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mADD dist.zip\u001b[m\u001b[2m\u001b[3m). So for the single-service \u001b[24;6HArgoCD path, build-app should produce"]
[1064.7080380916595,"o"," a \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdist/ \u001b[m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mdirectory (not a zip), and the artifact paths should be \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdist/ \u001b[m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mnot \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[25;6H*.zip\u001b[m\u001b[2m\u001b[3m. Wait, let me reconsider. The \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mDockerfile.frontend-argocd.example \u001b[m\u001b[2m\u001b[3msays: \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m# - cicd-template 的 build-container \u001b[m\r\n     \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mjob 不打 zip，产物是 dist/ 目录 ... COPY dist/ /usr/share/nginx/html/ \u001b[m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mSo for the ArgoCD path, the build-app job \u001b[22m\u001b[23m   \r\n  \u001b[2m\u001b[3m\u001b[3Cshould produce \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdist/ \u001b[m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mas artifact (NOT zipped). The multi-service template's…\u001b[22m\u001b[23m\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m\r\n✶\u001b[1CUnravelling… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(14m 39s · ↓ 27.6k tokens\u001b[1C· thought fo\u001b[1C 49s)\u001b[K\r\n \u001b[1C⎿\u001b[1C \u001b[m□\u001b[1C生成\u001b[1CDockerfile（前端\u001b[1CArgoCD\u001b[1C路径）\r\n     □ 生成 nginx.conf\u001b[98C\r\n     □ 生成 .gitlab-ci.yml\u001b[94C\r\n     □ 产出 GitLab CI/CD Variables 清单\u001b[81C\r\n\u001b[120C\r\n\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m───────"]
